      "created_at": "2026-10-21T17:20:01Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-21T17:20:01Z",
      "body": "Thanks for taking the time on this. Since you opened it, the v2 rework of Network Survey (aba8bae6) removed LocalBroadcastManager entirely. SIM changes now go from SimChangeReceiver through a small in-process SimChanges signal. It runs the cellular controller before any screen, so the controller always refreshes its subscription list first. The fragments this PR changes are gone, so I'm closing it as superseded.",
      "author_association": "OWNER",
